    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1980b3da-71de-3c56-beef-c213a4a52a37",
                "word": "pataphysique",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "443b4f6a-77e4-39a4-a16d-235c5851309e",
                        "entry_id": "1980b3da-71de-3c56-beef-c213a4a52a37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "pataphysics (absurdist philosophy)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "humorous",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89e6b460-7940-49c9-a26b-3bf5fc9e0237",
                                "sense_id": "443b4f6a-77e4-39a4-a16d-235c5851309e",
                                "text": "La pataphysique, dont l’étymologie doit s’écrire ἔπι (μετὰ τὰ φυσικά) et l’orthographe réelle ’pataphysique, précédé d’un apostrophe, afin d’éviter un facile calembour, est la science de ce qui se surajoute à la métaphysique, soit en elle-même, soit hors d’elle-même, s’étendant aussi loin au delà de celle-ci que celle-ci au delà de la physique.",
                                "translation": "Pataphysics, whose etymology should be written as ἔπι (μετὰ τὰ φυσικά) and the actual orthography as ’pataphysics, preceded by an apostrophe to avoid a facile pun, is the science which, both in itself and beyond, expands metaphysics to the same degree as the latter physics.",
                                "english": "Pataphysics, whose etymology should be written as ἔπι (μετὰ τὰ φυσικά) and the actual orthography as ’pataphysics, preceded by an apostrophe to avoid a facile pun, is the science which, both in itself and beyond, expands metaphysics to the same degree as the latter physics."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
